<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>When you submit a consultation request through our website forms, we collect your name, phone number, and the health condition you select (such as Weight Loss, PCOD/PCOS, Diabetes, or Thyroid). If you contact us by phone, WhatsApp, or email, we may also collect the information you choose to share during that conversation.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use the information you provide to contact you about your consultation request, understand your nutrition and health needs, and provide personalized diet and wellness guidance. We do not use your information for any purpose unrelated to providing our services.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">3. How We Store and Protect Your Information</h2>
<p>Form submissions are processed through a secure, access-controlled system. We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal and health information from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">4. Sharing of Information</h2>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. Your information is used solely by Sanchi Nutrition &amp; Wellness to provide consultation and nutrition services to you.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">5. Your Rights</h2>
<p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time by contacting us at <a class="text-accent-green underline" href="mailto:sanchisingh1801@gmail.com">sanchisingh1801@gmail.com</a> or <a class="text-accent-green underline" href="tel:+917351189757">+91 73511 89757</a>.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">6. Cookies</h2>
<p>Our website may use basic cookies or similar technologies to ensure the site functions correctly. We do not use cookies for third-party advertising or tracking.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-title-lg text-xl text-primary mb-3">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
</div>
